{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40698","headline":"叙旧游寄栖白 · 李洞","name":"叙旧游寄栖白","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老着重袍坐石房，竺经休讲白眉长。\n省冲鼍没投江岛，曾看鱼飞倚海樯。\n晓炙冻盂原日气，夜挑莲椀禁灯光。\n吟诗五岭寻无可，倏忽如今四十霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}